# Code owners for Aixle Insights
#
# Each line maps a path pattern to the GitHub users or teams requested for review
# when matching files change. Later matches take precedence.
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/articles/about-code-owners
#
# The @AixleHQ/maintainers team must exist in the AixleHQ organization and hold
# write access on this repository — GitHub silently ignores rules naming a team
# it cannot resolve. Keep this list in sync with the maintainer roles described
# in GOVERNANCE.md.

# Default owners for everything in the repo
*                                   @AixleHQ/maintainers

